{"page":86,"verses":[{"verse_key":"4:45","surah":4,"ayah":45,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ أَعْلَمُ بِأَعْدَآئِكُمْ ۚ وَكَفَىٰ بِٱللَّهِ وَلِيًّا وَكَفَىٰ بِٱللَّهِ نَصِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God knows your enemies best: God is enough to protect and to help you.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"4:45"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"knows better","transliteration":"aʿlamu","verse_key":"4:45"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِأَعْدَآئِكُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"about your enemies","transliteration":"bi-aʿdāikum","verse_key":"4:45"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَكَفَىٰ","en_gloss":"and (is) sufficient","transliteration":"wakafā","verse_key":"4:45"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"4:45"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَلِيًّۭا","en_gloss":"(as) a Protector","transliteration":"waliyyan","verse_key":"4:45"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَكَفَىٰ","en_gloss":"and sufficient","transliteration":"wakafā","verse_key":"4:45"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(is) Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"4:45"},{"pos":9,"ar":"نَصِيرًۭا","en_gloss":"(as) a Helper","transliteration":"naṣīran","verse_key":"4:45"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٤٥","en_gloss":"(45)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"4:45"}]},{"verse_key":"4:46","surah":4,"ayah":46,"ar_uthmani":"مِّنَ ٱلَّذِينَ هَادُوا۟ يُحَرِّفُونَ ٱلْكَلِمَ عَن مَّوَاضِعِهِۦ وَيَقُولُونَ سَمِعْنَا وَعَصَيْنَا وَٱسْمَعْ غَيْرَ مُسْمَعٍ وَرَٰعِنَا لَيًّۢا بِأَلْسِنَتِهِمْ وَطَعْنًا فِى ٱلدِّينِ ۚ وَلَوْ أَنَّهُمْ قَالُوا۟ سَمِعْنَا وَأَطَعْنَا وَٱسْمَعْ وَٱنظُرْنَا لَكَانَ خَيْرًا لَّهُمْ وَأَقْوَمَ وَلَـٰكِن لَّعَنَهُمُ ٱللَّهُ بِكُفْرِهِمْ فَلَا يُؤْمِنُونَ إِلَّا قَلِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Some Jews distort the meaning of [revealed] words: they say, ‘We hear and disobey,’ and ‘Listen,’ [adding the insult] ‘May you not hear,’ and ‘Raina [Look at us],’ twisting it abusively with their tongues so as to disparage religion. If they had said, ‘We hear and o